\details{
The MHN density (Sun et al. 2023, Lemma 1a) is
\deqn{f(x \mid \alpha, \beta, \gamma) =
  \frac{2 \beta^{\alpha/2} x^{\alpha-1}
  \exp(-\beta x^2 + \gamma x)}{\Psi[\alpha/2, \gamma/\sqrt{\beta}]}
